    {
      "block": 1,
      "text": "Besides, every time I learn something new, it pushes some old stuff out of my brain.",
      "start": 4.52,
      "end": 9.48
    },
    {
      "block": 1,
      "text": "Remember when I took that home winemaking course, and I forgot how to drive?",
